{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","巨剑斗魂"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","生成斗猎围场，使其内部的所有人受到外部的治疗和伤害降低，我方角色在内部额外增加攻击力和生命汲取。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，戈丹选择1格范围内的1名敌人，举起大剑挑战对方，使对方定身5秒，同时生成一个两人为中心的斗猎围场，对其中的所有敌人造成180% ATK伤害，并且击退围场内的其余远程敌人。\n斗猎围场持续16秒，在其范围内的所有角色受到来自外部的治疗和伤害都降低60%。我方角色在斗猎围场内额外增加20% + 3%攻击力和40点生命汲取，并且造成伤害提升20% + 3%。同一时间戈丹只能维持一个斗猎围场。该技能初始拥有1000能量。 "],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":148,"end":153,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":176,"end":181,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","我方角色在围场内额外增加的攻击力提升至24% + 3%，造成伤害提升增加至24% + 3%，生命汲取提升至45。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":40,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","我方角色在围场内额外增加的攻击力提升至28% + 3%，造成伤害提升增加至28% + 3%，生命汲取提升至50。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":40,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","我方角色在围场内额外增加的攻击力提升至32% + 3%，造成伤害提升增加至32% + 3%，生命汲取提升至55。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":40,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","我方角色在围场内额外增加的攻击力提升至36% + 3%，造成伤害提升增加至36% + 3%，生命汲取提升至60。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":40,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg10"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","踏锋饮血"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标敌人造成伤害，并将伤害转化为自身护盾。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","戈丹短暂蓄力后斜扫一刀对敌人造成280% + 40% ATK伤害，同时获得造成伤害100%加上300% ATK的护盾，持续15秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":47,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至400% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至460% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","崩裂斩"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","击倒目标敌人并造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","戈丹跳起后从上方劈下，对敌人造成350% + 50% ATK伤害并将其击倒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至400% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至450% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成伤害提高至500% + 50% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","血气激昂"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","在斗猎围场内击败敌人会使自身其他技能永久升级。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","戈丹在斗猎围场内第一次参与击败非召唤物敌人，或在斗猎围场内累计作战20秒后，使技能“踏锋饮血”和“崩裂斩”获得升级。 \n踏锋饮血：额外附带目标当前已损失生命值30%的额外伤害。额外伤害最高不超过戈丹600% ATK。\n崩裂斩：戈丹会在跳起时将敌人击飞，并将击倒时间延长至2秒，同时额外造成300% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"},{"start":99,"end":107,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":144,"end":152,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“踏锋饮血”的额外伤害提升至目标当前已损失生命值35%。额外伤害最高不超过戈丹700% ATK。“崩裂斩”的额外伤害提升至350%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每当戈丹在斗猎围场内参与击败非召唤物敌人时，自身永久提高40%的护甲与魔抗，最多叠加3次，同时在后续的3秒内每秒回复自身15%最大生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“踏锋饮血”的额外伤害提升至目标当前已损失生命值40%。额外伤害最高不超过戈丹800% ATK。“崩裂斩”的额外伤害提升至400%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":39,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","在斗猎围场内击败敌人后可以跳向其他敌人，并移动其位置。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每当戈丹在斗猎围场内参与击败敌人时，戈丹可以跳向下一个敌人并将斗猎围场移动到脚下，同时使斗猎围场的持续时间额外增加10秒。我方角色在围场内额外增加50点穿透。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","狩猎之刃"]]}